   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>“Asal Bağlantı” oyununda çizgiyle birbirine bağlanmış her iki dairedeki sayılar <b>aralarında asal</b> olmak zorundadır. Aşağıdaki oyun tahtasında bir daire boş bırakılmıştır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" width=\"540\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Çizgilerle bağlı daireler: boş daire 6, 35 ve 22 ile bağlı; 6 ile 35, 6 ile 25, 25 ile 22, 35 ile 9, 9 ile 22 birbirine bağlı\"><line x1=\"276.9\" y1=\"149.2\" x2=\"173.1\" y2=\"77.8\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"323.1\" y1=\"149.2\" x2=\"426.9\" y2=\"77.8\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"300\" y1=\"193\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"252\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"178\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"422\" y2=\"62\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"141.6\" y1=\"88.7\" x2=\"108.4\" y2=\"195.3\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"126.9\" y1=\"229.8\" x2=\"273.1\" y2=\"272.2\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"458.4\" y1=\"88.7\" x2=\"491.6\" y2=\"195.3\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"473.1\" y1=\"229.8\" x2=\"326.9\" y2=\"272.2\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"165\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"62\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#5b21b6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">6</text><circle cx=\"450\" cy=\"62\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#5b21b6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"450\" y=\"69\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">35</text><circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"280\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#5b21b6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">22</text><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"222\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#5b21b6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">25</text><circle cx=\"500\" cy=\"222\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#ede9fe\" stroke=\"#5b21b6\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><text x=\"500\" y=\"229\" font-size=\"20\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">9</text><text x=\"355\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6d28d9\">boş daire</text></svg></div><p><b>Oyunun kuralı bozulmadan boş daireye aşağıdaki sayılardan hangisi yazılabilir?</b></p>",
