   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Kırmızı blok 6 cm, mavi blok 10 cm.</li> <li>Kuleler eşit yükseklikte; toplam yükseklik 200 cm’den az.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>İki kuledeki toplam blok sayısının en büyük değeri.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Ortak yükseklik</b> Kırmızı kule 6’nın, mavi kule 10’un katıdır; eşit oldukları için yükseklik ortak kattır. <span class=\"sv-m\">EKOK(6, 10) = 30 → 30, 60, 90, 120, … cm</span></li> <li><b>Sınırı uygula</b> İki kulenin toplamı 200’den az olmalı. <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · 90 = 180 &lt; 200 ✓ &nbsp;|&nbsp; 2 · 120 = 240 ✗</span></li> <li><b>Blokları say</b> En fazla blok için 90 cm’lik kuleler seçilir. <span class=\"sv-m\">Kırmızı: 90 : 6 = 15 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Mavi: 90 : 10 = 9</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">Toplam: 15 + 9 = 24</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 460 265\" width=\"460\" role=\"img\"><rect x=\"140\" y=\"206.8\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"193.6\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"180.4\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"167.2\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"154\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"140.8\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"127.6\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"114.4\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"101.2\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"88\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"74.8\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"61.6\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"48.4\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"35.2\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"140\" y=\"22\" width=\"60\" height=\"13.2\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"198\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"176\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"154\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"132\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"110\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"88\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"66\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"44\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><rect x=\"260\" y=\"22\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"110\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"350\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"360\" y=\"27\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" font-weight=\"bold\">90 cm</text><line x1=\"120\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"340\" y2=\"220\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#b91c1c\" font-weight=\"bold\">15 kırmızı</text><text x=\"290\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\" font-weight=\"bold\">9 mavi</text><text x=\"230\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">15 + 9 = 24 blok; toplam 180 cm &lt; 200 cm</text></svg><figcaption>En yüksek uygun ortak yükseklik 90 cm.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Eşit uzunluk/yükseklik isteyen sorular ortak kat (EKOK’un katları) sorusudur.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> 8 (30 cm), 16 (60 cm) ara değerlerdir; 15 yalnız kırmızı bloklardır.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
