   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Yükseklikleri santimetre cinsinden 2k, 3k ve 5k olan üç çeşit kutudan üçer tane vardır (k bir doğal sayıdır). Bu kutularla aşağıdaki üç blok oluşturulmuştur.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 285\" width=\"540\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Üç blok: 1. blok yukarıdan aşağı 2k, 5k, 3k; 2. blok 3k, 2k, 5k; 3. blok 5k, 3k, 2k santimetrelik kutulardan oluşuyor\"><rect x=\"30\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"57\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2k cm</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"74\" width=\"90\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5k cm</text><rect x=\"30\" y=\"184\" width=\"90\" height=\"66\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"128\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3k cm</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">1. blok</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"66\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3k cm</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"96\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"123\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2k cm</text><rect x=\"210\" y=\"140\" width=\"90\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5k cm</text><text x=\"255\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">2. blok</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"30\" width=\"90\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"488\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5k cm</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"140\" width=\"90\" height=\"66\" fill=\"#fbcfe8\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"488\" y=\"178\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3k cm</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"206\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" fill=\"#bae6fd\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"488\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2k cm</text><text x=\"435\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">3. blok</text></svg></div><p>Blokların kutularının yeri değiştirilmeden üç blok herhangi bir sırayla üst üste konularak bir kule yapılıyor. Ardından kulenin <b>en üstündeki iki kutu</b> alınıyor.</p><p><b>Buna göre kulenin son yüksekliği santimetre cinsinden aşağıdakilerden hangisi <u>olamaz</u>?</b></p>",
